      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;With its upcoming release Debian 6.0 aka Squeeze, for the first time, Debian users will have the choice between a Linux and a FreeBSD kernel.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </abstract>
